<PageLayout lang="en" title="Privacy Policy" description="Demlio privacy policy: what data is collected, how cookies and advertising partners are used, and what your rights are as a reader." alternates={staticPages.privacy}>
  <p><em>This is a template; update it with your own details before going live and consult a lawyer if needed (GDPR).</em></p>
  <h2>Data we collect</h2>
  <p>Demlio has no accounts or forms. Visit statistics may be measured anonymously.</p>
  <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
  <p>Third-party vendors, including Google, may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits. You can opt out of personalised advertising in Google Ads Settings.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>When you click an affiliate link, the store may set its own cookie to attribute the sale to us.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions: contact@example-domain.com</p>
</PageLayout>
